# Frontend (React + Inertia)

## Components
- React functional components with hooks only; no class components.
- Pages are Inertia pages (`resources/js/Pages`); use Inertia `Link`, `useForm` and `router` for navigation and forms.

## Design
- Use the UI/UX Pro Max skill (`.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max`) when building or restyling public blog pages and the writers' dashboard.

## Tenant branding
- Tenant logo and brand color come from shared Inertia props (`usePage().props`).
- Apply the brand color via the CSS variable `--brand` (set once at the layout root) and reference `var(--brand)` in styles; never hard-code tenant colors.
- Validate colors as `#rrggbb` (regex `^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$`) on the server and in forms; fall back to a default when invalid.

## Dependencies
- No new UI libraries (component kits, CSS frameworks, icon packs) without asking first.
